@startuml
actor User
boundary "views/declares/new.html.erb" as View
control "DeclaresController" as Controller
entity "Declare Model" as Model
database "Database" as DB

User -> View: Fill out declare form and submit
View -> Controller: Send POST /declares request
Controller -> Model: Create new declare object
Model -> DB: Save declare to database
DB --> Model: Return success/failure
Model --> Controller: Return new declare object
Controller -> View: Redirect to declares show page
View -> User: Display new declare
@enduml
